[{"answer":"My dentist called my house the other day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"He told me I needed my teeth cleaned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I set up an appointment to see him on Saturday, June 10th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"When I got to my dentist's office, I had to sit in the waiting room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"There were other people ahead of me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"They finally called my name.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I went into his room and sat down on a big blue chair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"They leaned it back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"A bright light was turned on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It hurt my eyes, so I closed them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"My dentist asked me to open my mouth. I did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought my mouth was very big,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but he told me to open it even wider!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Soon he began poking around to see if I had any cavities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He flossed my teeth and put fluoride around my teeth too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"The fluoride tasted like bubble gum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to spit into a dish-like bowl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It squirted out water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My dentist kept asking me questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I couldn't answer because there were weird tools in my mouth!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"When I tried answering back, he seemed to understand though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"His helper came into the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"She asked me to open my mouth again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to clamp down on something that felt like rubber.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"She put a big camera-type machine right next to my cheek.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"She did this on the other side of my face as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"They took two pictures of my teeth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It was really cool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"The dentist told me my teeth were perfect!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't have any problems. I could go home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"\"See you next year,\" he said.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/131-the-dentist-appointment-2019-04-07-04-22-54/31.mp3"}]
